  "description": "**We are currently offering framesets only. No ability for complete bicycle builds.**\n\nCurrent turn-around for a frameset is 8-10, a complete bike is 10-12 weeks until shipment. This could be extended depending on options chosen. Please ask.\n*We no longer use downtube shift bosses as pictured. We have changed to a double cable stop under the downtube near the headtube for better cable routing.\n\nFEATURES AND INFORMATION\nDesigned And Developed By Milwaukee Bicycle Co. - Handmade By Waterford Precision Cycles*\n\nTUBING\nModern high-quality steel gives you a soulful connection between you, the bike, and the open road. Yet the lightweight THRMLX tubing and Milwaukee Road geometry makes the frame stiff enough to stomp up steep hills, yet comfortable to spend the day riding.\n\nTIRE CLEARANCE\nClearance for 32c Tires.\n\nBRAKE CABLE ROUTING\nTop Tube Underside Brake Cable Routing.\n\nSTOCK DERAILLEUR ROUTING\nFront/Rear Derailleur Under DT Double Cable Stop\n\nBRAZE-ONS\nSeat Tube and Down Tube Mounted Water Bottle Bosses\nTop Tube Brake Cable Guides\nFront and Rear Derailleur Cable Stops\nRear Fender Bosses\nStainless Steel Milwaukee Headbadge, Milwaukee Script And WI State Badges",
